  "prefLabel": "Jus 410.01 Contract",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Jus 410.01 Contract. Any charitable trust that agrees to permit a commercial co-venturer to conduct a charitable sales promotion on its behalf shall enter into a written agreement with the commercial co-venturer that complies with the requirements set forth in RSA 7:28-d, II.\n\nSource. #13455, eff 10-7-22; ss by #14162, eff 12-27-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/jus400.html"
